@timeline
title: Campaign Timeline

= Campaign Timeline

[? if attempt_emergency_seen = 1: * **4 February 1949:** attempt on the
  {!<span class="term term-royalist">!}Shah{!</span>!}; martial law,
  arrests, press restrictions, and the ban on the
  {!<span class="term term-left">!}Tudeh Party{!</span>!} follow. ?]
[? if constituent_assembly_seen = 1: * **Spring 1949:** the constituent
  assembly strengthens royal authority. ?]
[? if front_formed = 1: * **October–November 1949:** the palace protest brings the opposition
  coalition that becomes the
  {!<span class="term term-national-front">!}National Front{!</span>!}
  together. ?]
[? if chambers_open_seen = 1: * **18 February 1950:** the Sixteenth
  {!<span class="term term-parliament">!}Majles{!</span>!} opens; the First
  {!<span class="term term-senate">!}Senate{!</span>!} also opens that month. ?]
[? if credentials_seen = 1: * **May–June 1950:** successive credential
  decisions make the returned opposition deputies usable in the
  {!<span class="term term-parliament">!}Majles{!</span>!}. ?]
[? if gass_golshayan_rejected_committee = 1: * **25 November 1950:** the
  Special Oil Commission rejects the supplemental agreement. ?]
[? if gass_golshayan_rejected_majles = 1: * **11 January 1951:** the
  {!<span class="term term-parliament">!}Majles{!</span>!} approves the
  rejection. ?]
[? if razmara_assassination_seen = 1: * **7 March 1951:**
  {!<span class="term term-independent">!}Razmara{!</span>!} is
  assassinated. ?]
[? if nationalization_approved_committee = 1: * **March 1951:** the Oil
  Commission recommends nationalization. ?]
[? if nationalization_approved_majles = 1: * **15 March 1951:** the
  {!<span class="term term-parliament">!}Majles{!</span>!} approves the
  nationalization principle. ?]
[? if nationalization_approved_senate = 1: * **20 March 1951:** the
  {!<span class="term term-senate">!}Senate{!</span>!} approves the
  nationalization principle. ?]

