@chambers
title: <span class="term term-parliament">Majles</span> and <span class="term term-senate">Senate</span>

= {!<span class="term term-parliament">!}Majles{!</span>!} and {!<span class="term term-senate">!}Senate{!</span>!}

The Sixteenth {!<span class="term term-parliament">!}Majles{!</span>!}
contained 136 authorized places. The First
{!<span class="term term-senate">!}Senate{!</span>!} contained sixty.
A return, an approved credential, attendance, and practical use of a seat were
not the same thing.

* {!<span class="term term-parliament">!}Majles{!</span>!} returns:
  [+ majles_returns_recorded +] / 136
* Credentials approved: [+ majles_credentials_approved +]
* Members able to sit: [+ majles_usable_members +]
* Attending members: [+ majles_attending_members +]
[? if front_formed = 1: * {!<span class="term term-national-front">!}National Front{!</span>!}
  members able to sit: [+ majles_national_front_usable +] ?]
[? if senate_convened = 1: * {!<span class="term term-senate">!}Senate{!</span>!} members able to sit:
  [+ senate_usable_members +] / 60
* {!<span class="term term-senate">!}Senate{!</span>!} attending members:
  [+ senate_attending_members +] ?]

Further reading: the official Sixteenth-{!<span class="term term-parliament">!}Majles{!</span>!}
roster, pp. 1–11; official
{!<span class="term term-parliament">!}Majles{!</span>!} proceedings,
sessions 2, 25, and 30; and the official
First-{!<span class="term term-senate">!}Senate{!</span>!} roster.

