@events
title: Historical Notes

= Historical Notes

[? if attempt_emergency_seen = 1: **1949** ?]

[? if attempt_emergency_seen = 1: The attempt on the
{!<span class="term term-royalist">!}Shah{!</span>!}
became the occasion for martial law, repression, and constitutional revision.
?]
[? if front_formed = 1: The October palace protest arose from the disputed
Sixteenth-{!<span class="term term-parliament">!}Majles{!</span>!} election
and brought together the coalition that became the
{!<span class="term term-national-front">!}National Front{!</span>!}. ?]

[? if tehran_rerun_seen = 1: **1950** ?]

[? if tehran_rerun_seen = 1: The Tehran rerun returned a small
{!<span class="term term-national-front">!}National Front{!</span>!} cohort.
?]
[? if credentials_seen = 1: Credentials made that cohort usable in stages. ?]
[? if oil_committee_formed = 1: The Special Oil Commission gave its deputies
a forum from which the supplemental agreement could be examined term by term.
?]

[? if gass_golshayan_rejected_majles = 1: **1951** ?]

[? if gass_golshayan_rejected_majles = 1: The
{!<span class="term term-parliament">!}Majles{!</span>!} approved the
commission's rejection of the supplemental agreement on 11 January. ?]
[? if razmara_assassination_seen = 1:
{!<span class="term term-independent">!}Razmara{!</span>!} was assassinated
on 7 March. ?]
[? if nationalization_approved_majles = 1: The commission and
{!<span class="term term-parliament">!}Majles{!</span>!} approved the
nationalization principle. ?]
[? if nationalization_approved_senate = 1: The
{!<span class="term term-senate">!}Senate{!</span>!} completed the documented
sequence on 20 March. ?]

