@bibliography
title: Sources

= Sources

The campaign's principal works include:

* Fakhreddin Azimi, *Iran: The Crisis of Democracy, 1941–1953*.
* Ervand Abrahamian, *Iran Between Two Revolutions*.
* Mostafa Elm, *Oil, Power, and Principle*.
* David S. Painter and Gregory Brew, *The Struggle for Iran*.
* Official proceedings and rosters of the Sixteenth
  {!<span class="term term-parliament">!}Majles{!</span>!}, the Special Oil
  Commission, and the First {!<span class="term term-senate">!}Senate{!</span>!}.

{!<a href="timeline.html#bibliography">!}Full bibliography and source notes{!</a>!}.

